    <h2>Tracking your time</h2>
        <p>You can track time spent on your trailer by either using <a href="https://lapse.hackclub.com/">Lapse</a> or by journaling - follow <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/18mAqzKjQgGmFW-BEkVi28VvouvtpxVlkRL8yUKbOg7U/edit?usp=sharing">this</a> template and make a copy. If you're planning on using Lapse, then you can sign in with Hack Club to record your timelapses and integrate them with your hackatime project.</p>
    </div>

<div class="bg-[#fb4bb0] rounded-xl p-5 mt-10">
<p>coming soon</p>
</div>

</div>
